        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wakumi amusanu aibili wabwami bwa-Peka mwana wa-Remaliya, Ahazi mwana wa-Jotamu wakaba mwami wa-Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
