        {
          "text": "Wakeenda munzila zyabami ba-Israyeli. Alimwi wakatuuzya mwana wakwe mumulilo mbubonya mbuli ziyanza zisesemya zyabamasi Jehova mbaakatanda kubusyu bwabana ba-Israyeli, ",
