        {
          "text": "Elyo kwakasika Rezini mwami wa-Aramu a-Peka mwana wa-Remaliya mwami wa-Israyeli kuzoolwisya Jerusalemu. Nkabela bakasinkilizya Ahazi, pele bakakacilwa kumuzunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
