        {
          "text": "Lino Abazi wakatuma batumwa kuli-Tigilati-Pilesere mwami wa-Asuri, wati, Ndime mulanda wako, ndime mwanaako, Boola kundivuna kumaanza aamwami wa-Aramu akumaanza aamwami wa-Israyeli, nkaambo bandicitila inkondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
