        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami wa-Asuri wakamuzuminina, wakeza ku-Damasko, wauzunda akutola bantu bawo mubuzike ku-Kiri. Alakwe Rezini wakamujaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
