        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami Ahazi naakaya ku-Damasko kuyooswanaana a-TigilatiPilesere mwami wa-Asuri, wakabona cipaililo caku-Damasko, nkabela mwami Ahazi wakatumina mupaizi Urija cikozyano cacipaililo, mbucakayakidwe akucitwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mupaizi Urija wakayaka cipaililo. Mbubonya mbuli mwami Ahazi mbwaakamutumina kuzwa ku-Damasko, mupaizi Urija wakacicita mbubonya, mwami katana sika kuzwa ku-Damasko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
