          "text": "Acipaililo camukuba icakali kubusyu bwa-Jehova, wakacigwisya kunembo lyaŋanda mpocakabede akati kacipaililo cakwe aŋanda ya-Jehova, wacibika kubbazu lyakunyika lyacipaililo cakwe. ",
