        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami Ahazi wakalailila mupaizi Urija kuti, Acipaililo cipati mpomweelede kutenta cipaizyo cacifumo acituuzyo camangolezya, acipaizyo camwami acituuzyo cakwe, azipaizyo zyabantu boonse banyika, azituuzyo zyabo azipaizyo zyabo zyakunywa, alimwi amusansaile alincico bulowa boonse bwacipaizyo abulowa boonse bwacituuzyo, Pele cipaililo camukuba ncencico ncinjanda kusondya. ",
